# Frontend Development Guidelines

When doing any frontend work, please adhere to the following:

1.  **Styling and Components**: Utilize [DaisyUI](mdc:https:/daisyui.com) for all styling and UI components.
2.  **Design Approach**: Always adopt a mobile-first design methodology. Ensure designs are responsive and look great on mobile devices before considering larger screens.
